on just made my a.m. I actually stopped drinking Smoothie King for a couple of years because I just became tired of hoping for a good smoothie and having it come out gross. I used to love Blueberry Heaven and this a.m. My boyfriend bought me one and it was perfect. LaRon, you have restored my faith. Y'all don't let nobody else make your smoothie until LaRon has personally trained them...and yes, I called the store to find out who he was and what his likely schedule is. Since his schedule changes, I just saved the store number under LaRon King so that I can make sure he's there."},{"business_id":"7pC1G5IQlcCQJddS9rN1pA","review_id":"X_jqxh6zjzVilVJP54N-Qw","date":"2012-04-12T13:30:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9016743302345276,"text_excerpt":"Smoothie King where the men are sexy and the woman are sweet! Nothing tastes better than a cold slim-n-trim strawberry after a hot day of yard work. This place is always clean and the staff is usually pretty nice. Parking is easy and prices are reasonable. YUM!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7pC1G5IQlcCQJddS9rN1pA","photo_id":"t-FaToUpjqZHv3dG0ixNBQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/t-FaToUpjqZHv3dG0ixNBQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
